    }
  ],
  "explanation": "The pipeline begins with a Strategic Architect generating a comprehensive draft covering hardware simplification, delivery partnerships, and analytics prioritization for India, Kenya, and Vietnam. A Smallholder Context Expert then reviews the draft against emerging-market realities to surface gaps in localization. The Strategy Refiner integrates this expert feedback into an improved, market-specific plan. A Quality Validator runs in a while loop (max 3 iterations) to ensure the refined strategy is concrete, coherent, and free of inappropriate large-farm assumptions; if it falls short, the loop sends it back to the Strategy Refiner for another pass. Finally, the Executive Polisher formats the approved strategy into a C-suite-ready deliverable."
